# Keep the build context small, and keep host-specific files out of the image.
# node_modules in particular holds platform-specific binaries (this repo is
# developed on Windows; the image is Linux), so the image installs its own.

.git
.claude
**/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/coverage
backend/coverage.out
backend/coverage.html
**/*.exe
**/*.log
**/.env
**/*.local
